SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                2500
NumberOfInitializationCycles  1000
PrintEvery                    500

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
WriteEnergyHistogram          yes
ComputeEnthalpyOfAdsorption   yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 2
HeliumVoidFraction 0.877
ExternalTemperature 300.0
ExternalPressure 1e4

Component 0 MoleculeName       n-pentane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 0.0197439
            TranslationProbability   1.0
            RotationProbability      1.0
            ReinsertionProbability   1.0
            SwapProbability          1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules  5

Component 1 MoleculeName       N2
            MoleculeDefinition local
            TranslationProbability   1.0
            RotationProbability      1.0
            ReinsertionProbability   1.0
            SwapProbability          1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules  5

